# Edits the program playing on the Device's MIDI channel with NRPN; set the
# Tetra's MParamRec to NRPN or All. Getting the program isn't supported yet.
synth "DSI Tetra"
pause 1
device 1
port din
template nrpn d+B0 63 ph | d+B0 62 pl | d+B0 06 vh | d+B0 26 vl
list offon "Off" "On"
